+# Candidate readiness display repair
+
+Goal: distinguish persisted candidates from actual send readiness without altering any outreach gate or receipt.
+
+Observed: the authenticated hosted workspace showed nine "可自动触达" candidates while its disabled execution button said "暂无待开发客户". Hosted execution is intentionally unavailable through that button; the current private research queue has zero ready sends. Browser reads and refreshed CRM access were healthy.
+
+Changes: label the workspace and queue as candidates awaiting verification; show an explicit Codex execution instruction on the hosted disabled button and its reason; explain the final live checks beside the queue. Preserve candidate selection, ICP, territory, history, unknown-send locks and disabled state.
+
+Verification: run existing queue guard, browser recovery, login and hosted boot regressions; build through the supported Sites source workflow; deploy owner-private; refresh actual workspace and queue to confirm the candidate count and disabled reason. No forced logout or test message. Record the actual result and publication provenance separately.
+
+Boundary: this display repair does not connect an unattended executor, extend cookies or restore a held delivery channel. Existing private receipts and anonymous statistics must remain unchanged.
+
+Independent review also confirmed that the intelligence panel's 23 planned actions are a 2026-09-02 snapshot. Display its original generatedAt and historical-suggestion labels; preserve the snapshot and do not imply a current plan or new verification.
